# ==============================================================================
# ai-subscription-manager 加固版 .gitignore
# 放置位置：仓库根目录
# 目的：把「个人订阅台账 / API 余额 / 使用明细」彻底挡在版本库之外
# 注意：.gitignore 不支持行尾注释，所有说明必须独占一行
# 来源：GitHub 隐私加固交付合集 2026-09-09
# ==============================================================================

# ---------- 1. 个人台账数据（核心，禁止入库）----------
subscriptions.json
balances.json
usage_data.json
budget.json
ledger.json
ledger-*.json
balances-*.json

# ---------- 2. 导出产物 ----------
dashboard.html
out.html
report.html
report-*.html
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# ---------- 3. 备份与临时 ----------
backup.json
backup-*.json
*.bak
*.tmp
*.log

# ---------- 4. 凭据 ----------
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
credential.json
credential-*.json

# ---------- 5. 常规 ----------
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ---------- 6. 白名单：产品库与模式文件必须入库 ----------
!products.json
!rates.json
!token_prices.json
!categories.json
!function_tags.json
!subscription_schema.json
!example-*.json
